/span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">ㅇ 대상 : 공과대학 취업준비생 (사전 참가 신청)</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">ㅇ</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 내용</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 공학분야의 구인·구직의 대학생과 기업과의 취업상담으로 우수 중견기업 11개 기업 참여의 취업상담부스 운영 </span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 취업준비생들의 부스 방문을 통한 문의 및 상담, 현장 면접 등 진행</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">ㅇ 상담 안내</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 상담시간 : 기업당 10~15분 내외, 신청순으로 사무국에서 배정</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 준비물 : 이력서, 성적증명서, 졸업예정(재학)증명서 등 (뒷장 참조)</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>- 신청시 하단 이메일로 상담을 원하는 기업명과 희망일자, 학생 학번,연락처,이메일주소 기입요망</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>&nbsp;기업설명회</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">ㅇ 일시 : 2012년 11월 22일(목) 15:00 ~ 16:00</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">ㅇ 장소 : 킨텍스 1전시장 3홀 내 세미나룸1</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-